From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] deepseek-v4.1: thin-M wo_a GEMM and packed decode prologue

Default off. VLLM_DSV41_THIN_WOA: grouped wo_a projection (8 x [M,4096] x
[4096,1024] bf16) for small M as a short-chain tensor-core Triton kernel
(45-47 us vs cuBLAS 50 us at M=6; fp64 error <= cuBLAS, deterministic).
VLLM_DSV41_PACKED_PROLOGUE: decode prologue H2D copies packed into one
transfer + one unpack kernel (bitwise); measured no engine gain, not enabled.

